KaTeX_*.ttf.gz are KaTeX's fonts (https://github.com/KaTeX/KaTeX), gzipped,
as RaTeX ships them (crates/ratex-katex-fonts at the commit pkg/ratex/build
pins). They are licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1, in
OFL.txt beside them; KaTeX's MIT license covers its software, not these
fonts.
